google-chrome --disable-background-networking
sed -i 's/^exec\s.*chrome"/& --simulate-outdated-no-au="Tue, 31 Dec 2099"/g' $(readlink -f /usr/bin/google-chrome)
Enable QUIC/HTTP3 in Google Chrome:
    chrome://flags -> Search for Experimental QUIC protocol
Enable QUIC/HTTP3 in Mozilla Firefox:
    about:config -> network.http.http3.enabled
